		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Azure dragon-kin related to white dragons. Two legs and wings, no arms, stands as tall as a human.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 28, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +5 (2d6) or 1 frost blast, <strong>MV</strong> near (burrow, fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +1, <strong>C</strong> +1, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> -1, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 6</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Frost Blast</strong>. Gout frost blast within double near. All creatures in a near-sized cube around where the blast lands, DEX 12+ or 3d6 damage. Cannot use again for 1d6 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Frostblood</strong>. Cold immune.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
